 validate;missing;msg
 :Access Public Instance
 missing←~(∆propertyNames∊{6::'' ⋄ ⍵.required}∆schema)/isSet
 :If ∨/missing
     msg←'Required field(s) missing: ',1↓∊',',¨missing/∆schema.required
     msg ⎕SIGNAL 6
 :ElseIf ∨/isSet
     {}(isSet/∆properties)validateField¨↓isSet⌿∆propertyNames,⍪fieldValues
 :EndIf
